window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-shiraishi-asuka"]=[{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p75-1","v":"y3v1","y":3,"o":33,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yoshida-kenta shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka shiraishi  the early riser at the next desk is already at her desk studying on a tablet when ayanokoji arrives unusually early   good morning to you  too   yes  i woke up unusually early today  but you re early too  ayanokouji kun   why did you decide to transfer to this class  ayanokouji kun   i can t believe you d choose to drop to a lower class after finally making it to class a   of course  i understand that  but that s to save us  no one has explained how this would benefit you  ayanokouji kun   i have a high regard for you  ayanokouji kun  so i honestly have high expectations   he likes me   next time  please be sure to tell me the reason why you transferred  polite  perceptive and direct   presses ayanokoji on why he transferred  sees things  from the outside  calmly turns yoshida s words against him  and states plainly that yoshida likes her but she d never choose him  her calm insight makes ayanokoji suspect there s more to her than a  kind neighbor  his new desk neighbor  questions him closely and volunteers to introduce him to friends  aware he likes her  rejects him outright and manipulates him into helping ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p75-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Shiraishi, the early riser at the next desk<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V1 · p.75–84<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Is already at her desk studying on a tablet when Ayanokōji arrives unusually early.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"yoshida-kenta.html\">Yoshida Kenta<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Good morning to you, too.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;…Yes, I woke up unusually early today. But you&#x27;re early too, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Why did you decide to transfer to this class, Ayanokouji-kun?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I can&#x27;t believe you&#x27;d choose to drop to a lower class after finally making it to Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Of course, I understand that. But that&#x27;s to save us. No one has explained how this would benefit you, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I have a high regard for you, Ayanokouji-kun, so I honestly have high expectations.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;He likes me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Next time, please be sure to tell me the reason why you transferred.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.84<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Polite, perceptive and direct — presses Ayanokōji on why he transferred, sees things &quot;from the outside,&quot; calmly turns Yoshida&#x27;s words against him, and states plainly that Yoshida likes her but she&#x27;d never choose him; her calm insight makes Ayanokōji suspect there&#x27;s more to her than a &quot;kind neighbor.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75–84<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> His new desk neighbor; questions him closely and volunteers to introduce him to friends.<span class=\"pg\">p.75–84<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yoshida Kenta<\/b> Aware he likes her; rejects him outright and manipulates him into helping Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.81–83<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p152-1\">→ After: Shiraishi up close at karaoke; signaling the prank<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p152-1","v":"y3v1","y":3,"o":33,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nishikawa-ryouko morishita-ai shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka shiraishi up close at karaoke  signaling the prank  i ve been wanting to have a proper conversation with you at least once  ayanokouji kun   it s never very relaxing at school   ryouko san is my best friend   now that we re in the same class  let s exchange contact information   maybe not for you  ayanokouji kun  but i genuinely interpret it that way   i m sorry  i couldn t just leave ayanokouji kun feeling troubled  warm and physically familiar   closes the distance until their clothes almost touch  touches his hand and admires his fingers  calls their being seated together  fate  silently signals morishita s prank timing to help him  her eyes convey not romance but curiosity at  an interesting experimental subject  sits close  exchanges numbers  helps him catch morishita s prank  sees him as a fascinating subject  her best friend  signals the eraser prank timing so ayanokoji can catch her  finds their exchange  cute","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p152-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Shiraishi up close at karaoke; signaling the prank<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V1 · p.152–162<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"nishikawa-ryouko.html\">Nishikawa Ryōko<\/a> · <a href=\"morishita-ai.html\">Morishita Ai<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;ve been wanting to have a proper conversation with you at least once, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.153<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s never very relaxing at school.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.153<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Ryouko-san is my best friend.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.153<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Now that we&#x27;re in the same class, let&#x27;s exchange contact information.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.153<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Maybe not for you, Ayanokouji-kun, but I genuinely interpret it that way.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.154<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry. I couldn&#x27;t just leave Ayanokouji-kun feeling troubled.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.161<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Warm and physically familiar — closes the distance until their clothes almost touch, touches his hand and admires his fingers; calls their being seated together &quot;fate&quot;; silently signals Morishita&#x27;s prank timing to help him; her eyes convey not romance but curiosity at &quot;an interesting experimental subject.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.152–162<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Sits close, exchanges numbers, helps him catch Morishita&#x27;s prank; sees him as a fascinating subject.<span class=\"pg\">p.152–162<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nishikawa Ryōko<\/b> Her best friend.<span class=\"pg\">p.153<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Morishita Ai<\/b> Signals the eraser-prank timing so Ayanokōji can catch her; finds their exchange &quot;cute.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.157–162<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p75-1\">← Before: Shiraishi, the early riser at the next desk<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p258-1\">→ After: &quot;The Secrets She Harbors&quot;: drawn to the empty seat<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p258-1","v":"y3v1","y":3,"o":33,"k":"narration","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka  the secrets she harbors  drawn to the empty seat arrives at school earlier than anyone  takes her seat  and gazes at the empty seat on her left   now ayanokoji s   troubled by his transfer   this is troubling  isn t it   there s a  mountain of problems  isn t there   i am  foolish  aren t i   why did you decide to transfer to this class  ayanokouji kun    asked aloud harbors inexpressible feelings she understands but pretends not to  draws ayanokoji s face on her tablet to learn his expressions  deletes it when he appears  and listens intently to his  voice with little inflection  resolving to memorize it  watches his empty seat and questions his transfer  wants to know his true intentions","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p258-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">&quot;The Secrets She Harbors&quot;: drawn to the empty seat<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V1 · p.258–260<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at school earlier than anyone, takes her seat, and gazes at the empty seat on her left — now Ayanokōji&#x27;s — troubled by his transfer.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;This is troubling, isn&#x27;t it?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.258<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;…There&#x27;s a… mountain of problems, isn&#x27;t there?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.258<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;…I am… foolish, aren&#x27;t I?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.259<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;Why did you decide to transfer to this class, Ayanokouji-kun?&quot; — asked aloud<span class=\"pg\">p.260<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Harbors inexpressible feelings she understands but pretends not to; draws Ayanokōji&#x27;s face on her tablet to learn his expressions, deletes it when he appears, and listens intently to his &quot;voice with little inflection,&quot; resolving to memorize it.<span class=\"pg\">p.258–260<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Watches his empty seat and questions his transfer; wants to know his true intentions.<span class=\"pg\">p.258–260<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p152-1\">← Before: Shiraishi up close at karaoke; signaling the prank<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p263-1\">→ After: &quot;An Extra Pair of Ears&quot;: entranced by his voice<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p263-1","v":"y3v1","y":3,"o":33,"k":"narration","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu nishikawa-ryouko yoshida-kenta shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka  an extra pair of ears  entranced by his voice presses the phone to her right ear  eavesdropping on the conversation between nishikawa  yoshida and ayanokoji about the  hundred man slayer  rumor   aah  it s this voice after all  isn t it   does that  hundred man slayer  expression change to the  two hundred man slayer  when it reaches two hundred   as expected  your way of thinking is wonderful  ayanokouji kun   sakayanagi san  please leave the rest to me  entranced by ayanokoji s  clinical and colorless  voice   a voice impossible to analyze yet which makes her heart race  belittles yoshida s voice as a  racket  by comparison and decides to hear him in person rather than through the phone  eavesdrops on him  delighted by his reasoning that a specialist in any field is worthy of respect  resolves to go to him directly  announces to her  off page  that she ll handle matters from here  hears her  hundred man slayer  voice on the phone  refers to her as ryouko san  hears his  flat and uninteresting  voice  which irritates her by comparison","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p263-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">&quot;An Extra Pair of Ears&quot;: entranced by his voice<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V1 · p.263–264<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Presses the phone to her right ear, eavesdropping on the conversation between Nishikawa, Yoshida and Ayanokōji about the &quot;Hundred-Man Slayer&quot; rumor.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"nishikawa-ryouko.html\">Nishikawa Ryōko<\/a> · <a href=\"yoshida-kenta.html\">Yoshida Kenta<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;Aah… It&#x27;s this voice after all, isn&#x27;t it?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.263<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;Does that &#x27;Hundred-Man Slayer&#x27; expression change to the &#x27;Two-Hundred-Man Slayer&#x27; when it reaches two hundred?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.263<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;As expected, your way of thinking is wonderful, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;Sakayanagi-san. Please leave the rest to me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Entranced by Ayanokōji&#x27;s &quot;clinical and colorless&quot; voice — a voice impossible to analyze yet which makes her heart race; belittles Yoshida&#x27;s voice as a &quot;racket&quot; by comparison and decides to hear him in person rather than through the phone.<span class=\"pg\">p.263–264<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Eavesdrops on him, delighted by his reasoning that a specialist in any field is worthy of respect; resolves to go to him directly.<span class=\"pg\">p.263–264<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Announces to her (off-page) that she&#x27;ll handle matters from here.<span class=\"pg\">p.264<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nishikawa Ryōko<\/b> Hears her &quot;Hundred-Man Slayer&quot; voice on the phone; refers to her as Ryouko-san.<span class=\"pg\">p.263<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yoshida Kenta<\/b> Hears his &quot;flat and uninteresting&quot; voice, which irritates her by comparison.<span class=\"pg\">p.263<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v1-p258-1\">← Before: &quot;The Secrets She Harbors&quot;: drawn to the empty seat<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p43-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nishikawa-ryouko kitou-hayato shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 2   depth read  shiraishi digs deeper invites ayanokoji to lunch  arranges the group and proposes everyone share private life details   if you d like  would you care to have lunch with me in the cafeteria today   fufufu  doesn t that sound interesting  i m all for it    on including kitou cheerful and sociable  orchestrates the group and steers the conversation toward knowing one another  invites him to lunch  supports him and questions why he hid his ability  friends with her  calls her by first name  approves of including him in the meal","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p43-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi digs deeper<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.43–54<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Invites Ayanokōji to lunch; arranges the group and proposes everyone share private-life details.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"nishikawa-ryouko.html\">Nishikawa Ryōko<\/a> · <a href=\"kitou-hayato.html\">Kitō Hayato<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If you&#x27;d like, would you care to have lunch with me in the cafeteria today?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Fufufu. Doesn&#x27;t that sound interesting? I&#x27;m all for it.&quot; — on including Kitou<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful and sociable; orchestrates the group and steers the conversation toward knowing one another.<span class=\"pg\">p.52–63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Invites him to lunch, supports him and questions why he hid his ability.<span class=\"pg\">p.52–63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nishikawa Ryōko<\/b> Friends with her; calls her by first name.<span class=\"pg\">p.52–63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kitō Hayato<\/b> Approves of including him in the meal.<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p52-1\">→ After: Shiraishi&#x27;s lunch circle<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p52-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"yoshida-kenta kitou-hayato shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka shiraishi s lunch circle  ayanokouji kun  would you mind if i took a moment of your time   if you d like  would you care to have lunch with me in the cafeteria today   of course  that s fine  it s not like i was planning on having any particularly difficult discussions   morishita san  would you care to join us as well   fufufu  doesn t that sound interesting  i m all for it  cheerful and socially deft   invites ayanokoji  expands the circle to nishikawa and others  watches yoshida s antics with a warm smile  and finds inviting kitou  interesting  amused by his transparent attempt to muscle into the invitation  enthusiastically approves inviting him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p52-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Shiraishi&#x27;s lunch circle<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.52–54<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"yoshida-kenta.html\">Yoshida Kenta<\/a> · <a href=\"kitou-hayato.html\">Kitō Hayato<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Ayanokouji-kun. Would you mind if I took a moment of your time?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If you&#x27;d like, would you care to have lunch with me in the cafeteria today?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Of course, that&#x27;s fine. It&#x27;s not like I was planning on having any particularly difficult discussions.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Morishita-san, would you care to join us as well?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Fufufu. Doesn&#x27;t that sound interesting? I&#x27;m all for it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful and socially deft — invites Ayanokōji, expands the circle to Nishikawa and others, watches Yoshida&#x27;s antics with a warm smile, and finds inviting Kitou &quot;interesting.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52–54<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yoshida Kenta<\/b> Amused by his transparent attempt to muscle into the invitation.<span class=\"pg\">p.52–54<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kitō Hayato<\/b> Enthusiastically approves inviting him.<span class=\"pg\">p.53<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p43-1\">← Before: Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi digs deeper<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p55-1\">→ After: Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi digs deeper<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p55-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 2   depth read  shiraishi digs deeper invites ayanokoji to lunch  arranges the group and proposes everyone share private life details   if you demonstrated your current potential from the very beginning  ayanokouji kun  horikita san s class a would have surely earned more class points by now   you can t truly know someone without seeing their private life","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p55-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi digs deeper<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.55–65<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Invites Ayanokōji to lunch; arranges the group and proposes everyone share private-life details.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If you demonstrated your current potential from the very beginning, Ayanokouji-kun, Horikita-san&#x27;s Class A would have surely earned more Class Points by now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You can&#x27;t truly know someone without seeing their private life.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><\/ul><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p52-1\">← Before: Shiraishi&#x27;s lunch circle<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p126-1\">→ After: Ch.4 — depth read: Shiraishi&#x27;s deliberate mystery<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p126-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 4   depth read  shiraishi s deliberate mystery is in the elevator with ayanokoji and walks with him briefly in the morning  interrupts again after school to walk back to school with him   well  i hold our former leader  sakayanagi san  in high regard  walk together  she probes his deduction and then resets their introduction  defends her former leader s legacy against hashimoto   may i ask a small question  you ve concluded that the exam is based on our everyday conduct  ayanokouji kun  but what would you say the probability of that is","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p126-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 — depth read: Shiraishi&#x27;s deliberate mystery<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.126–137<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Is in the elevator with Ayanokōji and walks with him briefly in the morning; interrupts again after school to walk back to school with him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Well, I hold our former leader, Sakayanagi-san, in high regard.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;May I ask a small question? You&#x27;ve concluded that the exam is based on our everyday conduct, Ayanokouji-kun, but what would you say the probability of that is?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Walk together; she probes his deduction and then resets their introduction.<span class=\"pg\">p.127, 146–151<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Defends her former leader&#x27;s legacy against Hashimoto.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p55-1\">← Before: Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi digs deeper<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p129-1\">→ After: Shiraishi&#x27;s deduction of the conduct exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p129-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka shiraishi s deduction of the conduct exam  well  i hold our former leader  sakayanagi san  in high regard   i thought i would join you all   i believe i have some understanding of what you wish to say   may i ask a small question  you ve concluded that the exam is based on our everyday conduct  ayanokouji kun  but what would you say the probability of that is   it seems you based your judgment on mashima sensei s comment to  try to act in a way that befits a student  ayanokouji kun  but i feel that alone is insufficient grounds for such a conclusion   a single statement shouldn t have been enough to narrow it down  but adding the information from the other classes feels like it s removing all the static  sharp and inquisitive   presses ayanokoji on his 90  figure  demands his reasoning  and follows the cross class hint logic to confirm the conduct exam  blends into the group s atmosphere  challenges and then accepts his deduction","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p129-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Shiraishi&#x27;s deduction of the conduct exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.129–138<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Well, I hold our former leader, Sakayanagi-san, in high regard.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I thought I would join you all.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I believe I have some understanding of what you wish to say.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.136<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;May I ask a small question? You&#x27;ve concluded that the exam is based on our everyday conduct, Ayanokouji-kun, but what would you say the probability of that is?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It seems you based your judgment on Mashima-sensei&#x27;s comment to &#x27;try to act in a way that befits a student,&#x27; Ayanokouji-kun, but I feel that alone is insufficient grounds for such a conclusion.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;A single statement shouldn&#x27;t have been enough to narrow it down, but adding the information from the other classes feels like it&#x27;s removing all the static.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.138<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sharp and inquisitive — presses Ayanokōji on his 90% figure, demands his reasoning, and follows the cross-class hint logic to confirm the conduct exam; blends into the group&#x27;s atmosphere.<span class=\"pg\">p.129–138<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Challenges and then accepts his deduction.<span class=\"pg\">p.137–138<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p126-1\">← Before: Ch.4 — depth read: Shiraishi&#x27;s deliberate mystery<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p138-1\">→ After: Ch.4 — depth read: Shiraishi&#x27;s deliberate mystery<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p138-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"morishita-ai shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 4   depth read  shiraishi s deliberate mystery is in the elevator with ayanokoji and walks with him briefly in the morning  interrupts again after school to walk back to school with him   it seems you based your judgment on mashima sensei s comment to  try to act in a way that befits a student  ayanokouji kun  but i feel that alone is insufficient grounds for such a conclusion   i thought you were a more reserved person  i must say  that was a bold question   there were actually quite a few who  like me  wanted to hold onto hope and believe in you   ahh  that just won t do   i m shiraishi asuka   and you who are you  playful and opaque   reintroduces herself as a test  never answers his question about her  deepening rather than resolving the mystery  notes his full name speech reminds her of morishita","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p138-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 — depth read: Shiraishi&#x27;s deliberate mystery<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.138–151<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Is in the elevator with Ayanokōji and walks with him briefly in the morning; interrupts again after school to walk back to school with him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"morishita-ai.html\">Morishita Ai<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It seems you based your judgment on Mashima-sensei&#x27;s comment to &#x27;try to act in a way that befits a student,&#x27; Ayanokouji-kun, but I feel that alone is insufficient grounds for such a conclusion.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.138<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I thought you were a more reserved person. I must say, that was a bold question.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There were actually quite a few who, like me, wanted to hold onto hope and believe in you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ahh... that just won&#x27;t do.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m Shiraishi Asuka.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;And you—who are you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Playful and opaque — reintroduces herself as a test, never answers his question about her, deepening rather than resolving the mystery.<span class=\"pg\">p.146–151<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Morishita Ai<\/b> Notes his full-name speech reminds her of Morishita.<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p129-1\">← Before: Shiraishi&#x27;s deduction of the conduct exam<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p211-1\">→ After: Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reveals herself as an observer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p211-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"","w":"shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 7   depth read  shiraishi reveals herself as an observer meets nanase back to back at a quiet restaurant to avoid being seen together","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p211-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reveals herself as an observer<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.211–222<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Meets Nanase back-to-back at a quiet restaurant to avoid being seen together.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p138-1\">← Before: Ch.4 — depth read: Shiraishi&#x27;s deliberate mystery<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p223-1\">→ After: Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reveals herself as an observer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p223-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"nanase-tsubasa ayanokouji-kiyotaka tsukishiro shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 7   depth read  shiraishi reveals herself as an observer meets nanase back to back at a quiet restaurant to avoid being seen together  calm and strategic   chose the covert meeting setup deliberately  sees through nanase s probes  and refuses to cooperate while reassuring her selectively  meets her secretly  refuses to provide intelligence  only reassures about hashimoto morishita  and warns of consequences if she is expelled   how i procured that information is a trade secret   that s because i am  strictly speaking  an observer   from the very beginning  i was never given any role beyond that   through an ironic twist of fate  he and i ended up in the same class   all that is required of us is to spend three years as ordinary students   if you wish to know  i suggest you ask your superiors directly  tsukishiro san  was it  reveals she is a white room  observer    tasked only to live as an ordinary student for three years  her proximity to ayanokoji is coincidence she chooses to enjoy  is his classmate and neighbor  enjoys the environment as an observer  names him as nanase s superior  does not like him  uses ayanokoji s own line  trade secret  back on him  per nanase s recollection","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p223-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reveals herself as an observer<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.223–230<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Meets Nanase back-to-back at a quiet restaurant to avoid being seen together.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;How I procured that information is a trade secret.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;That&#x27;s because I am, strictly speaking, an observer.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;From the very beginning, I was never given any role beyond that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calm and strategic — chose the covert meeting setup deliberately, sees through Nanase&#x27;s probes, and refuses to cooperate while reassuring her selectively.<span class=\"pg\">p.226–230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> Meets her secretly; refuses to provide intelligence, only reassures about Hashimoto/Morishita, and warns of consequences if she is expelled.<span class=\"pg\">p.226–230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Through an ironic twist of fate, he and I ended up in the same class.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;All that is required of us is to spend three years as ordinary students.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If you wish to know, I suggest you ask your superiors directly. Tsukishiro-san, was it?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Reveals she is a White Room &quot;observer&quot; — tasked only to live as an ordinary student for three years; her proximity to Ayanokōji is coincidence she chooses to enjoy.<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Is his classmate and neighbor; enjoys the environment as an observer.<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Names him as Nanase&#x27;s superior; does not like him.<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Uses Ayanokōji&#x27;s own line (&quot;trade secret&quot;) back on him, per Nanase&#x27;s recollection.<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p211-1\">← Before: Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reveals herself as an observer<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p226-1\">→ After: Shiraishi meets Nanase back-to-back: the observer revealed<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p226-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"nanase-tsubasa ayanokouji-kiyotaka tsukishiro sakayanagi-arisu shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka shiraishi meets nanase back to back  the observer revealed sits alone at the back of a quiet restaurant  back to back with nanase across the sofa  speaking without looking at her   not at all  i only just arrived myself   visually speaking  that may be so  however  it s impossible for anyone to imagine our relationship from this back to back situation   how i procured that information is a trade secret   even if you threaten me  cooperation is a difficult matter   i sympathize with your feelings  but i must decline to offer my assistance   that s because i am  strictly speaking  an observer   from the very beginning  i was never given any role beyond that   through an ironic twist of fate  he and i ended up in the same class   if you wish to know  i suggest you ask your superiors directly   that if i am expelled before ayanokouji senpai s fate is decided  things may very well head in a direction that shirogane sensei would not desire  reveals she is a white room  observer  tasked only to live three years as an ordinary student  refuses nanase s request to get ayanokoji expelled  and warns that her own expulsion before his fate is decided would displease shirogane  calm and strategically brilliant   chose the back to back meeting to avoid being read  saw through nanase s probes  the emphasis on  nishikawa  the second phone  used ayanokoji s own line  trade secret  and engineered the situation so her proximity to him is explained by  ironic  chance  meets her secretly  refuses to help expel ayanokoji and warns her about shirogane  an  observer  of him  admits an  impulse  to close the distance now they are classmates and adjacent seats  names him as nanase s superior   not that i m fond of him  notes sakayanagi has voluntarily withdrawn from the school","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p226-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Shiraishi meets Nanase back-to-back: the observer revealed<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.226–230<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sits alone at the back of a quiet restaurant, back-to-back with Nanase across the sofa, speaking without looking at her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Not at all. I only just arrived myself.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Visually speaking, that may be so. However, it&#x27;s impossible for anyone to imagine our relationship from this back-to-back situation.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;How I procured that information is a trade secret.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>13 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Even if you threaten me, cooperation is a difficult matter.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I sympathize with your feelings, but I must decline to offer my assistance.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That&#x27;s because I am, strictly speaking, an observer.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;From the very beginning, I was never given any role beyond that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Through an ironic twist of fate, he and I ended up in the same class.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If you wish to know, I suggest you ask your superiors directly.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That if I am expelled before Ayanokouji-senpai&#x27;s fate is decided... things may very well head in a direction that Shirogane-sensei would not desire.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Reveals she is a White Room &quot;observer&quot; tasked only to live three years as an ordinary student; refuses Nanase&#x27;s request to get Ayanokōji expelled, and warns that her own expulsion before his fate is decided would displease Shirogane.<span class=\"pg\">p.226–230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calm and strategically brilliant — chose the back-to-back meeting to avoid being read, saw through Nanase&#x27;s probes (the emphasis on &quot;Nishikawa,&quot; the second phone), used Ayanokōji&#x27;s own line (&quot;trade secret&quot;), and engineered the situation so her proximity to him is explained by &quot;ironic&quot; chance.<span class=\"pg\">p.226–230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> Meets her secretly; refuses to help expel Ayanokōji and warns her about Shirogane.<span class=\"pg\">p.226–230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> An &quot;observer&quot; of him; admits an &quot;impulse&quot; to close the distance now they are classmates and adjacent seats.<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Names him as Nanase&#x27;s superior; &quot;not that I&#x27;m fond of him.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Notes Sakayanagi has voluntarily withdrawn from the school.<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p223-1\">← Before: Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reveals herself as an observer<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p255-1\">→ After: &quot;The Voice Hidden Within&quot;<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p255-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"narration","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shirogane shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka  the voice hidden within  reflects on ayanokoji seeing through her observer disguise   it may be conceited of me to say  but hadn t you been watching me  to some extent  before i transferred classes   ahh  that just won t do   i am shiraishi asuka   and you who are you  torn between the duty of an observer  to meet shirogane sensei s expectations  and her own feelings   she feels a kind of gratitude that he saw through her  and for the first time gives a genuine self introduction from the heart  asking who he truly is  reveals herself to him  her  first true introduction  her duty as an observer comes from shirogane sensei   not on the roster  recorded as a note","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p255-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">&quot;The Voice Hidden Within&quot;<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.255–256<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Reflects on Ayanokōji seeing through her observer disguise.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;It may be conceited of me to say, but hadn&#x27;t you been watching me, to some extent, before I transferred classes?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;Ahh... that just won&#x27;t do.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;I am Shiraishi Asuka.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Narration<\/span> &quot;And you—who are you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.256<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Torn between the duty of an observer (to meet Shirogane-sensei&#x27;s expectations) and her own feelings — she feels a kind of gratitude that he saw through her, and for the first time gives a genuine self-introduction from the heart, asking who he truly is.<span class=\"pg\">p.255–256<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reveals herself to him; her &quot;first true introduction.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.255–256<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">shirogane<\/b> Her duty as an observer comes from Shirogane-sensei — not on the roster, recorded as a note.<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v2-p226-1\">← Before: Shiraishi meets Nanase back-to-back: the observer revealed<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p14-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 1   depth read  the food problem  looking at the rules  if we can keep running away  we won t lose for the time being  paintballs won t be consumed unless we fight  but the food problem is unavoidable  points out the meager food forces event participation and combat   a sharp strategic observation  shares her analysis of the food supply constraint","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p14-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1 — depth read: the food problem<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.14–45<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Looking at the rules, if we can keep running away, we won&#x27;t lose for the time being. Paintballs won&#x27;t be consumed unless we fight, but the food problem is unavoidable.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Points out the meager food forces event participation and combat — a sharp strategic observation.<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Shares her analysis of the food/supply constraint.<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p31-1\">→ After: The food problem makes running away impossible<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p31-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka the food problem makes running away impossible picks up a box of nutritional supplement blocks during the supply debate   looking at the rules  if we can keep running away  we won t lose for the time being  paintballs won t be consumed unless we fight  but the food problem is unavoidable  sharp strategic read   identifies that the meager food forces event participation and combat  narrowing any passive strategy","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p31-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The food problem makes running away impossible<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.31<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Picks up a box of nutritional supplement blocks during the supply debate.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Looking at the rules, if we can keep running away, we won&#x27;t lose for the time being. Paintballs won&#x27;t be consumed unless we fight, but the food problem is unavoidable.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sharp strategic read — identifies that the meager food forces event participation and combat, narrowing any passive strategy.<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p14-1\">← Before: Ch.1 — depth read: the food problem<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p46-1\">→ After: Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi as VIP and messenger<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p46-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shimazaki-ikkei shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 2   depth read  shiraishi as vip and messenger  h9  on his own does that mean it s koenji   i was able to confirm that the gps at h9 is koenji kun s  his role is apparently a guard  acts as a vip and radio messenger to the commander  confirms koenji split off  struggles to keep up during the retreat and can t communicate due to exhaustion  relays reports and is placed in the front row as a vip  receives intel from him as commander  via radio","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi as VIP and messenger<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.46–85<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shimazaki-ikkei.html\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;H9? On his own?...Does that mean it&#x27;s Koenji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I was able to confirm that the GPS at H9 is Koenji-kun&#x27;s. His role is apparently a guard.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.55<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Acts as a VIP and radio messenger to the commander; confirms Koenji split off; struggles to keep up during the retreat and can&#x27;t communicate due to exhaustion.<span class=\"pg\">p.46–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Relays reports and is placed in the front row as a VIP.<span class=\"pg\">p.52–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/b> Receives intel from him as commander (via radio).<span class=\"pg\">p.46–74<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p31-1\">← Before: The food problem makes running away impossible<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p52-1\">→ After: Confirming Kōenji; forming the formation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p52-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka confirming koenji  forming the formation  h9  on his own does that mean it s koenji   i was able to confirm that the gps at h9 is koenji kun s  his role is apparently a guard   understood  for now  let s move on to the next matter  identifies the isolated gps as koenji and confirms the identity check result  then approaches ayanokoji as the next report comes in","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p52-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Confirming Kōenji; forming the formation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.52–55<\/span><\/h3><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;H9? On his own?...Does that mean it&#x27;s Koenji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I was able to confirm that the GPS at H9 is Koenji-kun&#x27;s. His role is apparently a guard.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.55<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Understood. For now, let&#x27;s move on to the next matter.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.55<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Identifies the isolated GPS as Kōenji and confirms the Identity Check result, then approaches Ayanokōji as the next report comes in.<span class=\"pg\">p.52–55<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p46-1\">← Before: Ch.2 — depth read: Shiraishi as VIP and messenger<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p59-1\">→ After: Relaying the commander&#x27;s loophole findings<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p59-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"shimazaki-ikkei shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka relaying the commander s loophole findings relays a report from shimazaki about the commander s restrictions   apparently  the commanders were informed that during the special exam  direct contact  private conversations and any message like exchanges are prohibited  and the tablet s screenshot function is disabled  even if you try to use it  it will only save a completely black screen as the picture that s what he said   also  it seems the gps on the tablet s map has individual tags  and he found out it s possible to take notes on the gps of students from other classes  so  he said he made sure to put koenji kun s name on the gps marker at i9  where he s isolated  passes on detailed commander intel   the monitoring restrictions and the gps annotation trick that lets them track koenji by name  relays his findings about commander loopholes","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p59-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Relaying the commander&#x27;s loophole findings<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.59<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Relays a report from Shimazaki about the commander&#x27;s restrictions.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shimazaki-ikkei.html\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Apparently, the commanders were informed that during the special exam, direct contact, private conversations and any message-like exchanges are prohibited. And the tablet&#x27;s screenshot function is disabled; even if you try to use…<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Also, it seems the GPS on the tablet&#x27;s map has individual tags, and he found out it&#x27;s possible to take notes on the GPS of students from other classes. So, he said he made sure to put Koenji-kun&#x27;s name on the GPS marker at I9…<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Apparently, the commanders were informed that during the special exam, direct contact, private conversations and any message-like exchanges are prohibited. And the tablet&#x27;s screenshot function is disabled; even if you try to use it, it will only save a completely black screen as the picture—that&#x27;s what he said.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Also, it seems the GPS on the tablet&#x27;s map has individual tags, and he found out it&#x27;s possible to take notes on the GPS of students from other classes. So, he said he made sure to put Koenji-kun&#x27;s name on the GPS marker at I9, where he&#x27;s isolated.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Passes on detailed commander intel — the monitoring restrictions and the GPS annotation trick that lets them track Kōenji by name.<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/b> Relays his findings about commander loopholes.<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p52-1\">← Before: Confirming Kōenji; forming the formation<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p117-1\">→ After: Depth review: Class C&#x27;s recon commander<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p117-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka depth review  class c s recon commander speaks privately with ayanokoji after the surprise attack  assuring him she trusts him completely   at the very least  i trust you   then i ll make use of that trust without reservation   just as you said  ayanokouji kun  it s turned into quite a chaotic battle  hasn t it  acts as class c s commander over the radio  relaying other classes  positions and directing the gps jammer tactics  shows respect and a willingness to tell a  gentle lie  for someone s own good  or speak plainly when it is not   ayanokoji notes this diverges from his first impression of her  expresses no doubt about ayanokoji s leadership even after the failed prediction  which unsettles him  places unconditional trust in him and serves as his reconnaissance lead","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p117-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Depth review: Class C&#x27;s recon commander<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.117–232<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Speaks privately with Ayanokōji after the surprise attack, assuring him she trusts him completely.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;At the very least, I trust you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Then I&#x27;ll make use of that trust without reservation.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Just as you said, Ayanokouji-kun, it&#x27;s turned into quite a chaotic battle, hasn&#x27;t it?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Post<\/span> Acts as Class C&#x27;s commander over the radio, relaying other classes&#x27; positions and directing the GPS-jammer tactics.<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Shows respect and a willingness to tell a &quot;gentle lie&quot; for someone&#x27;s own good, or speak plainly when it is not — Ayanokōji notes this diverges from his first impression of her.<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Expresses no doubt about Ayanokōji&#x27;s leadership even after the failed prediction, which unsettles him.<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Places unconditional trust in him and serves as his reconnaissance lead.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–232<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p59-1\">← Before: Relaying the commander&#x27;s loophole findings<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p151-1\">→ After: Ch.5 — depth read: Class D&#x27;s trust impresses<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p151-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 5   depth read  class d s trust impresses  the charm class d possesses is incredible  impressed by how warmly class d treats the wary class c members as equals  lowering their guard  discusses the alliance and class d s strength with him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p151-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 — depth read: Class D&#x27;s trust impresses<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.151–166<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The charm Class D possesses is incredible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.160<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Impressed by how warmly Class D treats the wary Class C members as equals, lowering their guard.<span class=\"pg\">p.160<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Discusses the alliance and Class D&#x27;s strength with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.160<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p117-1\">← Before: Depth review: Class C&#x27;s recon commander<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p160-1\">→ After: Impressed by Class D&#x27;s trust<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p160-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka impressed by class d s trust  the charm class d possesses is incredible  impressed by how class d treats the wary class c members as equals and actively mingles  lowering their guard  discusses the alliance s balance with him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p160-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Impressed by Class D&#x27;s trust<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.160<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The charm Class D possesses is incredible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.160<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Impressed by how Class D treats the wary Class C members as equals and actively mingles, lowering their guard.<span class=\"pg\">p.160<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Discusses the alliance&#x27;s balance with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.160<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p151-1\">← Before: Ch.5 — depth read: Class D&#x27;s trust impresses<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p197-1\">→ After: Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reports the chaos<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p197-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shimazaki-ikkei shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka ch 7   depth read  shiraishi reports the chaos  the tactic s effect has worn off and it seems class a s current locations were all displayed at once   just as you said  ayanokouji kun  it s turned into quite a chaotic battle  hasn t it   i imagine class a is surprised right about now   so  they were skillfully outplayed by you alone  ayanokouji kun  calmly relays the battlefield state as recon commander  impressed by ayanokoji s manipulation of all three classes  reports to him and admiration for his outplaying of class a  prepares to use the individual gps shutdown on class d s vips","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p197-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reports the chaos<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.197–232<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shimazaki-ikkei.html\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The tactic&#x27;s effect has worn off and it seems Class A&#x27;s current locations were all displayed at once.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Just as you said, Ayanokouji-kun, it&#x27;s turned into quite a chaotic battle, hasn&#x27;t it?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I imagine Class A is surprised right about now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.231<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;So, they were skillfully outplayed by you alone, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calmly relays the battlefield state as recon commander; impressed by Ayanokōji&#x27;s manipulation of all three classes.<span class=\"pg\">p.230–232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reports to him and admiration for his outplaying of Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.230–232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/b> Prepares to use the individual GPS shutdown on Class D&#x27;s VIPs.<span class=\"pg\">p.231<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p160-1\">← Before: Impressed by Class D&#x27;s trust<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p230-1\">→ After: Reporting the chaotic battlefield<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p230-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shimazaki-ikkei shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka reporting the chaotic battlefield  the tactic s effect has worn off and it seems class a s current locations were all displayed at once   just as you said  ayanokouji kun  it s turned into quite a chaotic battle  hasn t it   just now  another one from class a  yukimura kun the second vip was eliminated   i imagine class a is surprised right about now  wondering why their three vips were found out and are being so persistently targeted   so  they were skillfully outplayed by you alone  ayanokouji kun   excuse me  there s a message from shimazaki kun  calmly relays the battlefield state as recon commander  impressed by ayanokoji s manipulation of all three classes  reports to him  left with yamamura as he heads to f11  prepares the individual gps shutdown on the class d vips per his orders","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p230-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Reporting the chaotic battlefield<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.230–232<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shimazaki-ikkei.html\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The tactic&#x27;s effect has worn off and it seems Class A&#x27;s current locations were all displayed at once.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Just as you said, Ayanokouji-kun, it&#x27;s turned into quite a chaotic battle, hasn&#x27;t it?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.230<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Just now, another one from Class A, Yukimura-kun—the second VIP—was eliminated.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.231<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I imagine Class A is surprised right about now. Wondering why their three VIPs were found out and are being so persistently targeted.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.231<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;So, they were skillfully outplayed by you alone, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;...Excuse me, there&#x27;s a message from Shimazaki-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Calmly relays the battlefield state as recon commander, impressed by Ayanokōji&#x27;s manipulation of all three classes.<span class=\"pg\">p.230–232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reports to him; left with Yamamura as he heads to F11.<span class=\"pg\">p.230–232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shimazaki Ikkei<\/b> Prepares the individual GPS shutdown on the Class D VIPs per his orders.<span class=\"pg\">p.231<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p197-1\">← Before: Ch.7 — depth read: Shiraishi reports the chaos<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p233-1\">→ After: Epilogue — depth read: reporting the final state<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p233-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami shiraishi-asuka","q":"shiraishi asuka epilogue   depth read  reporting the final state arrives breathless with yamamura  kanzaki and the two class d vips to report the situation after ayanokoji s solo action   yes  we were attacked by two class b students while we were running away  according to ichinose san  it seems those two had their personal gps signals turned off  so they completely caught us by surprise  recovers from the surprise attack and reports calmly despite being out of breath  confirms the surviving class b members and their location  reports to him  acknowledges his buying them time with his solo action  relays her information about class b s gps jamming attackers","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p233-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue — depth read: reporting the final state<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.233–252<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives breathless with Yamamura, Kanzaki and the two Class D VIPs to report the situation after Ayanokōji&#x27;s solo action.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Yes. We were attacked by two Class B students while we were running away... According to Ichinose-san, it seems those two had their personal GPS signals turned off, so they completely caught us by surprise.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Recovers from the surprise attack and reports calmly despite being out of breath; confirms the surviving Class B members and their location.<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reports to him; acknowledges his buying them time with his solo action.<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Relays her information about Class B&#x27;s GPS-jamming attackers.<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiraishi-asuka-y3v3-p230-1\">← Before: Reporting the chaotic battlefield<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
